WEBVTT

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:51.020
You'll definitely remember, Kaito!

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:03.500
Seira!

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:17.190
It's Summertime! Everyone Get Together!

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:44.220
Everyone's going to that newly opened resort club.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.940
At this rate, Maki-san's beach house is going to have to close down.

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.250
No way! How could that happen?

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:54.720
Even with Lucia working so hard by herself, it might not be enough.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:59.660
Yeah, especially when there's a fancy resort club opening nearby.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.000
It'll be okay!

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.710
I've got some additional help on the way!

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.200
Some additional help?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.570
Who are they, Lucia-san?

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:13.270
Hi! Lucia! Hanon! Rina! How are you!?

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.710
Eh?

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.740
You want us to help out in this almost-bankrupt restaurant?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.950
We just wanted to relax.

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.050
That's right, Lucia-san!

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.800
The rebuilding of the kingdoms has finally reached a turning point.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.120
They're allowed to rest a little!

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:33.160
They're the "additional help."

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:38.300
Lucia is really daring to even want Karen, Noelle, and Coco to help out.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:42.430
If you don't want to do it, I'm not going to force you to help.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.670
But for her to say that all of a sudden.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:47.110
Yeah.

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:48.530
I'm okay with it.

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:49.120
Huh?

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:53.250
Well, she helped me out with a pretty dangerous situation last time.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:57.050
We'll help out if it makes Lucia happy, right Noelle?

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:59.770
That's right! If that's what you want, Karen.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.790
Thank you! Karen! Noelle!

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:06.450
By the way, there are a lot of good-looking guys in the area!

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:10.360
You can all experience a short summer of love.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.030
Wouldn't that be nice?

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.730
Why didn't you say so earlier?

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:15.470
I'm now filled with energy!

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:23.910
The most important thing is to lure people to the restaurant.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:28.480
With our beauty, that{this} should be easy.

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.870
So, let's split up and get going!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.420
Just you wait for the results!

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.900
I've got a good feeling about this.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:35.620
Yeah.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:39.100
Then we better get inside and prepare for orders.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:45.790
There are absolutely no guests.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.320
That's strange.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.560
There's no way around it.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:54.800
With such a large resort club opening up, this restaurant is going to have to close sooner or later.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:55.900
Maki-san.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:01.290
Hey, let's go take a look outside.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:01.910
Okay.

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:09.660
Where did they go?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.920
Eh? What's going on?

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.360
Karen, watch out!

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:21.830
E-Excuse me! Please let me through! Excuse me!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:23.400
Karen!

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:31.920
Noelle! Karen!

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.780
What are you two doing?

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.450
We're playing beach volleyball.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:36.950
I'm not talking about that!

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:39.120
I'm asking why are you two playing beach volleyball!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.080
It seemed interesting!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:42.820
I give up.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.120
So that's why there are no guests.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:05:59.720
Oh!

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:01.380
Lucia!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.530
Coco!

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:07.230
Why are you here at the resort club!?

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:11.000
They invited me to eat all kinds of delicious foods!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:14.210
Everyone, how about a taste of this watermelon punch?

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.130
Moron! Moron!

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:24.910
Lucia, why are you trying so hard for this beach house?

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:29.570
That's right. If it were me, I would choose that resort club over there.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:30.700
That's true.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.470
You don't know about it...

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.370
...but Lucia has a reason for not losing this beach house.

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.310
What is it, Lucia?

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:39.680
What's going on?

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:43.250
It may be a regular beach house to all of you.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:48.400
But to me, it's a place that holds a lot of wonderful memories of Kaito and me.

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:52.110
That's why she told Maki-san not to close the restaurant.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:56.430
We were originally here to liven up this place. But...

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:58.130
I see.

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:01.250
It looks like you aren't just merely helping out.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:05.010
I'm sorry, Lucia. I'm sorry for not knowing about this.

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:09.990
Oh no. I should be apologizing to you all for crying over this.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.700
Don't worry about this, Lucia.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.570
Huh?

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.130
People are lured in by delicious food.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:21.450
After going to the resort club next door, I found{ that} out that they had lots of delicious things.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:27.020
So if this restaurant added some items for an original menu, the number of guests will increase.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:29.960
I see! The cooking seems like a good idea.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:34.960
I'll make some delicious food that you'll only be able to eat at this restaurant!

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:38.120
"Summer at its Peak: Southern Seafood Cuisine!" How about that?

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.330
Let me add some of my cooking as well!

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:44.480
"Perfect for Summer! Stamina-boosting Anglerfish!"

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.350
I'll also make something that will help your health and appearance!

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:50.640
"Mint-flavored Arctic Wind Cold Fruit Platter!"

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:52.870
You'll get more female guests!

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:56.770
Karen. Noelle. Coco. Thank you.

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:10.370
It's about time for lunch. The lucky first guest will be...

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.360
Welcome!

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:15.030
Huh? Kaito.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:18.740
Kaito, is this beach house the restaurant you like?

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:22.500
Yeah. Somehow, I can relax in this restaurant.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.480
Ah, I see.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:30.410
You two are really lucky! We've just come out with an original menu.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:31.550
Is it tasty?

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:32.870
Yeah! It's really delicious!

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:34.940
Please take your time and enjoy!

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:35.780
Okay!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:40.460
Hey, Kaito. Let's hurry up and go to that resort club over there.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.970
Maybe next time.

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:44.810
It's delicious!

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:46.340
Goodness, Kaito.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.420
Please tell your friends about this place, Kaito.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.320
Okay.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.320
Hey, Lucia.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.410
Is there something that I can help out with?

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.380
Nope! We're okay here.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:05.760
With my friends here helping out, it should be lively enough.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.060
I see. That's good.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.590
Come on, let's go, Kaito.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.930
Okay! I know, I know.

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:16.130
Thanks for coming!

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:20.350
I'll never let this restaurant close, Kaito.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:28.450
After Kaito-san and Mikaru-san left, we've had no other guests.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.880
If that's the case, then we'll go on the offensive ourselves!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:32.970
Go on the offensive?

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.470
What do you mean?

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:42.520
Weren't those the guys{people}{folks} that were playing beach volleyball before?

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.230
What are they planning?

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:47.450
Everyone, we just spoke with them.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.240
Hmm?

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:54.570
If we beat them in beach volleyball, the six guys over there will have lunch at the beach house.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:55.780
Oh!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:56.890
Yay!

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:58.490
But what if we lose?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:02.280
We have to go on a date with the six of them for a day.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.630
Eh?

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.220
That's a disaster!

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:15.230
Please, Kaito! Give me strength!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.360
Don't worry!

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:22.560
Do your best!

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:24.270
It's headed this way!

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:25.870
Leave it to me!

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:27.870
What the..!?

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:34.240
L-Lucia-san...

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.510
Lucia, what in the world are you doing?

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:43.540
I-I'm sorry!

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.880
I'm dragging everyone down.

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:48.590
Hey, hey. You aren't up for the challenge, are you?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.730
Be quiet! We're going on the offensive!

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:56.970
If you can turn the tables and win, then we'll have everyone watching here eat at your place!

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.900
Did everyone hear that just now?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.500
Yeah, I heard it clearly!

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.240
They say everyone who's watching...

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.300
That's around fifty or sixty people.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.910
In that case, we'll show you what we can do!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:09.070
T-They seem scary.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:12.320
Let's go, Coco!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:13.180
Okay!

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.490
Ice and Steel Wall of Perfection!

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:17.860
Block!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.120
What was that!? That's against the rules!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.830
Yay! Yay!

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.930
The Mermaid Princesses' powers are finally coming out!

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.400
I'm next!

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:35.440
Let's go! Tornado Serve!

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.110
Yay! Yay!

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:47.420
That was great!

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:49.850
Don't mess with Mermaid Power!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:54.390
What do I do!? It's coming!

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:57.730
Don't you care about the beach house closing down, Lucia-san?

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:59.490
Ah! No! It's not true!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:04.900
I won't let the beach house that holds so many{much of my} memories of Kaito and me down!

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.180
You've got to be kidding!

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:19.280
It's coming for Lucia-san again!

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:20.240
Leave it to me!

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:23.150
Blizzard Revolution Receive!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:24.250
Noelle!

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.860
Hailstorm Toss!

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:26.920
Here I go!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:32.130
Southern Ocean Hurricane Attack!

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:44.050
We won! We won! Hooray!

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:47.950
You did it, everyone! Congratulations!

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:52.940
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.690
Is my order ready?

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:03.500
Hey, I want to try that!

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:05.110
It's so tasty!

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:09.070
W-Wow. Today I'm guessing that I'll make as much income as for the entire summer.

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:16.080
I figured that just sitting around wasn't a good idea, but who would have thought that we would end up here?

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.740
How true.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:19.470
Hey, Sister Sheshe...

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:22.800
Don't you smell something delicious?

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:24.310
Now that you mention it...

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.500
Is it from there?

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:30.750
Welcome! Table for two...

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:31.120
Ah!

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:32.880
What do you mean by "ah?"

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:36.060
Don't just stand there! Show us to a table.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:39.490
Why are the two of them here?

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.100
I don't know!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:43.930
Maybe they're plotting something?

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:47.260
Sorry for the delay. Here's your order.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.190
Yeah, yeah. Don't just stand there.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:50.670
Please enjoy.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.900
The service crew here is really clumsy.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:59.250
What is this!? This doesn't taste good at all!

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:03.920
The food I got is the same way. It's all gooey and disgusting.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.530
This is bad! I can't eat any more of this!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.110
How true!

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.920
There isn't anyone cute serving us.

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.610
The service is horrible.

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.410
Let's go, Sister Mimi.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.120
That's right, Sister Sheshe.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.830
How dare they say that!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.230
This is unforgivable!

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:20.540
Just try to endure it!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:25.070
I knew that human cooking doesn't suit our tastes.

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:25.940
Wait!

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:29.450
Oh my! We've got three Mermaid Princesses here.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:34.080
It was worth it to eat such horrible cooking, Sister Sheshe.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.980
What did you say!? Say it one more time!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.280
We won't forgive you!

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:40.660
They seem to be angry.

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.480
We are' angry!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.480
We are' angry!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:43.590
Why?

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.260
Purple Pearl Voice!

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:49.820
Indigo Pearl Voice!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.130
Yellow Pearl Voice!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:09.050
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:23.030
No!

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.990
Hey, do we still have enough ingredients?

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:26.890
Huh?

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:29.710
Hippo, where are Karen, Noelle, and Coco?

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:31.690
They aren't in the restaurant?

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:34.550
Didn't they say they were going to help you?

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:35.880
They're not here.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:36.480
Eh?

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:39.350
Oh no!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:50.720
What's with them!? They're even more powerful than normal!

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:54.460
Is it because we ate that weird food that we can't exert any strength?

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.930
Hatred of food is a terrible thing!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.130
We're going to retreat for today, Sister Mimi!

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:00.010
That's right!

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:02.350
All right, we should get back.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:06.180
Let's do our best for the people who want to eat our cooking from the bottom of their hearts.

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.810
Not so fast!

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.750
What's going on!? Why is the sea parting?

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:33.560
I was watching all of that commotion.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:37.740
I'm so lucky that I ran into three Mermaid Princesses.

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:38.760
Who are you?

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.340
I guess this is the first time that we've met.

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:43.650
My name is Lady Bat.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.010
Lady Bat?

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:48.190
You're one of the servants of Mikeru that Lucia was talking about.

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:51.650
Your hearts belong to me.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:52.870
Eh?

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:55.300
Are you an idiot?

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:59.260
Now, let me treat you right with my concert!

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:02.360
T-This is...

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:04.660
My strength has left me...

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:13.020
Mikeru-sama will be happy that I caught three of them at once.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.310
Lady Bat!

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.420
That's enough!

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.310
Everyone, we're here to save you!

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:24.750
Eh? The six of them are here!

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:43.690
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:47.940
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.390
Green Pearl Voice!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.570
All right, let's go!

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:44.560
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:53.030
Love Shower Pitch!

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:57.170
How about an encore?

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:01.310
You all ganged up on me! How annoying!

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:10.210
I'm glad so many guests came!

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:12.910
Now Maki-san's beach house will be safe.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.710
This is all thanks to Karen, Noelle, and Coco.

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:17.250
Where were you!?

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:18.530
Hippo!

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.240
Why are you in human form?

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:24.090
It got so busy, and you all were missing!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:27.910
At least Maki-san and I were able to somehow deal with the guests.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:31.070
Lucia-san, please take care of closing up shop.

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:33.380
Eh? No way!

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:36.770
Darn!{Dammit!} Why does it have to be me doing this alone?

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.540
Even though I ended up dragging everyone down at beach volleyball.

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:43.480
Kaito!

00:21:44.890 --> 00:21:45.950
Hey, Lucia!

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:47.370
What's going on?

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:50.820
I figured I should at least come and help clean up after closing.

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:53.540
Kaito.

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.920
Even though I can only gaze at Kaito's face from a distance, I'm happy.

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:14.370
This restaurant has another set of new memories for the two of them.

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:14.880
Yeah.

00:23:49.940 --> 00:24:20.170
Preview

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:55.600
I wonder if there's a prince who will take me to the Starlight Party.

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:59.280
Hi, Nagisa-kun! Would you like to come play with us?

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:00.470
Hold on, Coco.

00:24:00.820 --> 00:24:03.180
Ah! Nagisa-kun is incredible!

00:24:03.180 --> 00:24:05.620
A guy who can split a watermelon while blindfolded is really cool.

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:08.160
He's even willing to get on a banana boat.

00:24:08.160 --> 00:24:09.760
He's so brave.

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:12.650
I think I love Nagisa-kun!

00:24:12.650 --> 00:24:15.640
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:20.170
<b>A Midsummer Night's Celebration</b>

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.340
A Midsummer Night's Celebration.

